# Azure Resource Naming Standards

## Core Naming Pattern
Naming Standards:
```
[Resource]-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]-[Suffix]
```

## Project-Specific Identifiers
- **Application Name**: `twdemo` (Taiwan Demo Application)
- **CIPS Identifier**: `mcips` (Microsoft Cloud Infrastructure Platform Services)
- **Environment**: `dev` (Development), `tst` (Testing), `prd` (Production)
- **Region**: `twn` (Taiwan), `hk` (Hong Kong), `sg` (Singapore)

## Azure Resource Naming Standards

### Resource Group
```
rg-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]
```
Example: `rg-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-functions`

### Function App
```
func-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]
```
Example: `func-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-citydata`

### Storage Account (24 character limit)
```
[Resource][Application][CIPS][Environment][Region][Description][Sequence]
```
Example: `satwmcipsdevtwnfunc01`

### Key Vault
```
kv-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]
```
Example: `kv-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-secrets`

### Cosmos DB Account
```
cosmos-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]
```
Example: `cosmos-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-data`

### Cosmos DB Database
```
db-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]
```
Example: `db-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-csvdata`

### Cosmos DB Collection
```
col-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]
```
Example: `col-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-records`

### Managed Identity
```
id-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Description]
```
Example: `id-twdemo-mcips-dev-funcaccess`

### Virtual Network
```
vnet-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Description]
```
Example: `vnet-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-core`

### Subnet
```
[VNetName]-snet-[Description]
```
Example: `vnet-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-core-snet-functions`

### SFTP Storage Account (24 character limit)
```
sftp[Application][CIPS][Environment][Region][Description][Sequence]
```
Example: `sftptwmcipsdevtwncsv01`

### SFTP User (3-64 characters, lowercase letters and numbers only)
```
sftp[Application][CIPS][Environment][Region][Description]
```
Example: `sftptwmcipsdevtwnuser`

### Blob Containers
```
[Description]-[Application]-[CIPS]-[Environment]-[Region]-[Sequence]
```
Example: `csv-uploads-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-01`, `csv-success-twdemo-mcips-prd-twn-01`

### Service Plan
```
plan-[FunctionAppName]
```
Example: `plan-func-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-citydata`

### User Assigned Identity
```
id-[KeyVaultName]
```
Example: `id-kv-twdemo-mcips-dev-twn-secrets`

### Storage Share
```
share-[StorageAccountName]-[Description]
```
Example: `share-satwmcipsdevtwnfunc01-content`

